Wait for custody acknowledgement before reopening transaction

The export retains an accepted submission until its Submitted sequence is acknowledged. Keep the next transaction open pending while callers consume events or fetch an object that blocks cumulative acknowledgement. Preserve custody and continue the other lanes.

Regression: delayed ack caused the previous client to fail on EBUSY even with no next record queued. Delayed-ack and object-hold controls now pass; test callers acknowledge custody before reusing the slot. Full standalone make check passes with strict warnings, nice 19 and two jobs.
